          },
          "test_procedure": "1. Enumerate all fields in electra.BeaconState and identify which fields are explicitly modified by upgrade_to_fulu (expected: fork, proposer_lookahead). 2. Create a pre-fork BeaconState with known values for all fields. 3. Execute upgrade_to_fulu and capture the post-state. 4. For each field NOT in the explicit modification list, assert post.F == pre.F. 5. Check for subtle corruption vectors: (a) deep-copy vs shallow-copy issues for nested structures, (b) default value initialization that overwrites existing data, (c) missing field assignments in new struct initialization, (d) type conversion errors during SSZ serialization/deserialization. 6. Verify field preservation under edge cases: maximum-size validators list, full historical roots, boundary epoch values.",
